# Copy to contracts/.env (git-ignored). Nothing here is required for the offline stack.

# BNB Chain RPC for fork tests and the forked dev chain (scripts/dev-up.sh). It must serve older state: a fork
# keeps reading state at its fork block, and pruned public nodes (bsc-dataseed.*) answer "missing trie node" a
# few minutes in, which crashes anvil. The keyless blastapi endpoint below serves older state; a provider key
# (NodeReal, QuickNode, ...) is faster and avoids rate limits.
BSC_RPC_URL=https://bsc-mainnet.public.blastapi.io
BSC_TESTNET_RPC_URL=https://bsc-testnet-rpc.publicnode.com

# Deploy.s.sol (testnet / mainnet). Not used by the local stack.
# DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY=
# ATLAS_BNB_USD_FEED_ID=0x00000000   # from Atlas onboarding
# ATLAS_SIGNER=0x59eD4701224fD9e2a85Ef2946c2ab828C1dDC600
# ATLAS_PUSH_FEED=0x0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
